00:00:07.202 --> 00:00:08.802
LIKE TO BE BRETT KAVANAUGH.

00:00:08.803 --> 00:00:10.504
DAVID SORENSON HAS SOME IDEA.

00:00:10.505 --> 00:00:13.006
HE ONCE WORKED AS A WHITE HOUSE

00:00:13.007 --> 00:00:13.440
SPEECHWRITER.

00:00:13.441 --> 00:00:15.108
HE WAS FIRED AFTER "THE

00:00:15.109 --> 00:00:16.043
