00:00:22.584 --> 00:00:24.418
TO RESPOND TO THE CHARGES, HE

00:00:24.419 --> 00:00:25.252
LOST HIS JOB.

00:00:25.253 --> 00:00:27.321
HIS REPUTATION WAS DESTROYED.

00:00:27.322 --> 00:00:29.489
IF CURRENT TREND CONTINUE, A LOT

00:00:29.490 --> 00:00:31.024
OF PEOPLE MIGHT LEARN WHAT THAT

00:00:31.025 --> 00:00:31.758
IS LIKE.

00:00:31.759 --> 00:00:33.460
DAVID SORENSON JOINS US TO TELL

00:00:33.461 --> 00:00:33.727
US.

00:00:33.728 --> 00:00:35.229
THANKS A LOT FOR COMING ON.

00:00:35.230 --> 00:00:38.031
&gt;&gt; THANKS FOR HAVING ME, TUCKER.

00:00:38.032 --> 00:00:39.700
&gt;&gt; Tucker: I'LL SAY IT UP FRONT.

00:00:39.701 --> 00:00:40.367
I KNOW NOTHING ABOUT YOUR

00:00:40.368 --> 00:00:41.902
MARRIAGE OR THE DETAILS EVEN OF

00:00:41.903 --> 00:00:42.436
THIS CASE.

00:00:42.437 --> 00:00:43.904
ALL I KNOW IS THAT YOU DID NOT

00:00:43.905 --> 00:00:45.539
HAVE A CHANCE TO RESPOND.

00:00:45.540 --> 00:00:46.974
THERE DIDN'T SEEM TO BE CONCRETE

00:00:46.975 --> 00:00:48.242
EVIDENCE THESE CHARGES WERE

00:00:48.243 --> 00:00:48.575
TRUE.

00:00:48.576 --> 00:00:53.447
THEY WERE MADE BY SOMEONE WHO, I

00:00:53.448 --> 00:00:55.082
