00:00:56.184 --> 00:00:57.117
WERE OVERWHELMING.

00:00:57.118 --> 00:00:59.620
WHAT WAS YOUR RESPONSE TO THIS?

00:00:59.621 --> 00:01:04.458
&gt;&gt; WELL, I FELT A DEEP AND

00:01:04.459 --> 00:01:05.659
PROFOUND FRUSTRATION.

