I THINK JUDGE KAVANAUGH IS

00:01:06.895 --> 00:01:08.095
FEELING THAT RIGHT NOW AS WE

00:01:08.096 --> 00:01:08.395
SPEAK.

00:01:08.396 --> 00:01:09.563
I NEVER THOUGHT I WOULD FEEL IN

00:01:09.564 --> 00:01:10.564
MY LIFE.

00:01:10.565 --> 00:01:12.733
THE FEELING OF HAVING YOUR

00:01:12.734 --> 00:01:15.168
REPUTATION THAT YOU'VE SO

00:01:15.169 --> 00:01:16.370
