00:01:29.584 --> 00:01:30.717
I COULDN'T IMAGINE HOW DIFFICULT

00:01:30.718 --> 00:01:32.286
IT MUST BE.

00:01:32.287 --> 00:01:34.821
I COULD, FOR JUDGE KAVANAUGH,

00:01:34.822 --> 00:01:38.292
AND THE SITUATION HE IS IN RIGHT

00:01:38.293 --> 00:01:38.558
NOW.

00:01:38.559 --> 00:01:39.726
IT IS TERRIBLE.

00:01:39.727 --> 00:01:41.728
YOUR REPUTATION IS SOMETHING

00:01:41.729 --> 00:01:42.029
THAT.

